# Flow of no particular shape, written by a script: 3 edges lead back, and a loop is entered past its head by an edge on which only what is live at the head tells what is live.
# b0 makes every value, so a value is live behind an await exactly where some way leads on from there to a block that reads it. The lists below come from going over the blocks again and again until nothing changes.
# RUN: sweep-code
# CHECK: # live at v8 [v0, v1, v2, v3]
# CHECK: # live at v10 [v0, v1, v2, v3, v5]
# CHECK: # live at v12 [v0, v1, v2, v3]
# CHECK: # live at v18 [v0]
# CHECK: # live at v19 [v0, v1, v2, v3, v5]
# CHECK: # live at v20 [v0, v1, v2, v3, v5]

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js"
function f0 name="waits" flags=[IsAsync] parameters=[{type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: anything):
    v1 = Await v0
    Return v1
}
entry module=m0

